<slide>
  class: spotlight
  valign: center
</slide>

<h2>class: spotlight</h2>

<p>
  This slide adds the CSS class <c>spotlight</c>, defined in the deck's own <c>deck.css</c>
  (loaded via <c>"css": "deck.css"</c> in <c>deck.json</c>).
</p>

<p><c>valign: center</c> centers this slide's content vertically.</p>

<notes>
  deck.css can restyle anything: .stage.spotlight .item h2 { ... }
</notes>
